      "description": "The actual white card text/action region. Package photography is deliberately omitted from this self-contained panel snippet.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-product-card\"><div class=\"ds-product-body\"><p class=\"ds-brand\">Dalda</p><h3>Cooking Oil</h3><p class=\"ds-unit\">4.5 Litre Bottle</p><div class=\"ds-product-meta\"><span>4.9</span><span>In stock</span></div><div class=\"ds-price\"><strong>Rs. 2,865</strong><del>Rs. 3,185</del></div><button class=\"ds-card-add\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg>Add to Basket</button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-product-card{background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#edf2f6);border:1px solid var(--line,#304256);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;min-width:0;font-family:Figtree,sans-serif;transition:border-color .2s}.ds-product-card:hover{border-color:#afc3ac}.ds-product-body{padding:8px 13px 13px}.ds-brand,.ds-unit{margin:0;font-size:11px;color:var(--secondary,#b3c1ce);line-height:1.5}.ds-product-body h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;min-height:42px;line-height:1.45;margin:3px 0}.ds-product-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;margin:11px 0;color:#486c4e}.ds-product-meta>span:first-child{color:#876b35}.ds-price{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-bottom:13px;white-space:nowrap}.ds-price strong{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-price del{font-size:11px;color:var(--secondary,#b3c1ce)}.ds-card-add{font-family:Figtree,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;background:#f0f5fa;color:var(--action,#e9bc6d);border:1px solid #cbdce8;border-radius:7px;width:100%;height:36px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600}.ds-card-add:hover{background:#e1ecd8}.ds-card-add:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold,#e9bc6d);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-product-card{transition:none}}"
